<p>Band paani kar diya aale payambar ke liye<br />
Mar gaye at'faale sarwar ek saaghar ke liye</p>

<p>Saath mera chodh do as'haab se kehte the shaah<br />
Saare jhagde ho rahe hai ek mere sar ke liye</p>

<p>Shaah kehte the koi aulaad waala kya nahi<br />
Thoda sa paani jo dede mere asghar ke liye</p>

<p>Phir nazar ki sooe nehre alqama aur ye kaha<br />
Mere gheerat'daar kya kehte ho quaahar ke liye</p>

<p>ho bhare darbaar me jab daaqela hamsheer ka<br />
Kuch to karna intezaam us waqt chaadar ke liye</p>

<p>Aaya'e tat'heer ke maalik the ab wo kya karei'n<br />
Betiyaa'n zahra ki hai mohtaaj chaadar ke liye</p>

<p>Hil gaye dil koofe waalo ke jo zainab ne kaha<br />
Zulm jo chaahe karo aale payambar ke liye</p>

<p>Kya karu'n bhai mera shaane kataakar so gaya<br />
Warna mai mohtaaj hoti ek chaadar ke liye<br />
</p>